(Refer Rule 26 of the SEZ Rules, 2006).', 'Supply of SCOMET Items from DTA to SEZ/Eo U and outside governs how DGFT business controls should be applied, validated, and enforced.', 'Supply of SCOMET Items from DTA to SEZ/Eo U and outside explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include An annual report of such supplies
